  "plot_summary": "[ASSET: left | VillainContinued | width=35%] The <b>Special Announcements Section</b> of [LINK:1964:ASM_12|ASM #12|2027-06-02] poses the interesting question about whether it is okay with readers if a villain is used for more than one story.\n\nThis sounds very much like Marvel testing reader reaction to the idea of continued stories.\n\n[ASSET: right | MoreLettersPages | width=20%] That same section of [LINK:1964:FF_26|FF #26|2027-06-05] featured this bit of information (see image to the right), that Letters Pages are soon coming to both <i>Avengers</i> and <i>X-Men</i> (and <i>Sgt. Fury</i> as well, though I don't review those issues, [PAGE: meanwhile | as detailed here]).",
